10. Testing is mandatory: write tests, RUN them, and fix failures yourself. Also run lint, type-check and build. Do not just report errors; fix root causes and re-run.
11. Detect my operating system (I may be on Windows). Use cross-platform commands/scripts and tell me exactly what to install if a tool (Docker, Node, Python, PostgreSQL, Redis) is missing. If Docker is unavailable, provide a documented fallback so work can continue.
